      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "These 'Critical Logic Conflict' errors are a direct result of the conflict between the low-complexity SMHP scripts and the dynamic, unpredicted forces introduced by the flare's magnetic interference. The system is attempting to reconcile impossible parameters, which is why it is flagging errors. I am currently rerouting the conflict resolution to a tertiary, non-critical buffer; this should stabilize the core logic within the next 30 seconds.",
